  "On 1h, %K stayed below 20 on 39,155 candles, which formed 2,543 separate moves. Twenty candles later, those entries were level with random ones, inside a luck band of -0.08% to 0.09%. The cross of %K up through %D below 20 enters about six times less often. It also lands inside its band, at 0.01%. The cross gave fewer entries, but the result did not change.",
  "Higher timeframes show the same pattern. On 4h, the cross of %K up through %D below 20 was 0.09% behind random, inside a band of -0.35% to 0.39%. On daily, it was 1.86% behind, inside -2.47% to 3.06%. On the short side, the cross down through %D above 80 on 4h was 0.18% worse than random, inside -0.36% to 0.38%.",
